\par \pard\plain \s5 \f2\fs20\lang2057 \{bmc b.bmp\} Integrated taskbar
\par \{bmc b.bmp\} Shell DDE for installation programs (see Start Properties)
\par \{bmc b.bmp\} Full drag and drop functions for taskbar
\par \{bmc b.bmp\} Incremental search for icon windows (press ".")
\par \{bmc b.bmp\} Aliases can be placed in the Applet Tray (see Taskbar topic)
\par \{bmc b.bmp\} Progress monitor showing bytes copied (click on the icon)
\par 
\par \pard\plain \s3\sa30 \b\f2\fs20\cf1\lang2057 Icon windows and Explorer
