\par \{bmc b.bmp\} Popup hints show exact byte size
\par \{bmc b.bmp\} Computer window automatically detects network connections
\par \{bmc b.bmp\} Explorer tree can return to the previous folder visited
\par \{bmc b.bmp\} Explorer tree can be opened showing a pre-defined directory
\par \{bmc b.bmp\} Folders do not display "0 bytes" in list view and hints
\par \{bmc b.bmp\} Explorer tree does not refresh file pane on every click
\par 
