\par \pard\plain \s5 \f2\fs20\lang2057 \{bmc b.bmp\} Taskbar can pop up when Calmira objects are dragged over it
\par \{bmc b.bmp\} Applet tray icons are highlighted when an applet is loaded
\par \{bmc b.bmp\} Start Menu always gains and restores the keyboard focus
\par \{bmc b.bmp\} New macros $LargeIconFolder, $SmallIconFolder and $ListFolder
\par \{bmc b.bmp\} Taskbar buttons have limited width for higher resolution displays
\par \{bmc b.bmp\} The taskbar does not show a pressed button for minimized apps
\par \{bmc b.bmp\} The Calmira desktop can be brought forward from the taskbar
\par \{bmc b.bmp\} Animation of the popup taskbar has been slowed down
\par 
