\par \{bmc b.bmp\} Progress bar's background colour can be adjusted
\par \{bmc b.bmp\} Internet shortcuts can be activated with a user-defined command
\par \{bmc b.bmp\} Run dialog can open root directories without a backslash
\par \{bmc b.bmp\} Find dialog has an improved layout
\par \{bmc b.bmp\} Windows 95 style progress bar
\par 
\par \pard\plain \s3\sa30 \b\f2\fs20\cf1\lang2057 Bug fixes
\par \pard\plain \s5 \f2\fs20\lang2057 \{bmc b.bmp\} Icons no longer disappear when window contents are changed
\par \{bmc b.bmp\} Icon captions are not wrongly drawn using the highlight colour
\par \{bmc b.bmp\} The Taskbar now always remains on top of other programs
