\par }DescriptionFile=descript.ion
\par \pard\plain \s5 \f2\fs20\lang2057 4DOS users can modify this to use a different filename
\par 
\par \pard\plain \s4 \f5\fs18\cf1\lang2057 DescriptionWidth=-1
\par \pard\plain \s5 \f2\fs20\lang2057 Controls the pixel width reserved for descriptions in list view (-1 for auto)
\par 
