\par \pard\plain \s5 \f2\fs20\lang2057 The spacing between list view columns
\par 
\par \pard\plain \s4 \f5\fs18\cf1\lang2057 ListKBDecimals=0
\par \pard\plain \s5 \f2\fs20\lang2057 The number of decimal places to use when displaying the size of files in kilobytes.  This only affects List View mode in icon windows
\par 
\par \pard\plain \s4 \f5\fs18\cf1\lang2057 LongDateTime=dddd d mmmm yyyy,  hh:mm am/pm
\par \pard\plain \s5 \f2\fs20\lang2057 This string formats the date and time in the {\uldb File Properties}{\v FileProp} dialog. See the explanation of date/time formats near the end of the topic.
\par 
\par \pard\plain \s4 \f5\fs18\cf1\lang2057 AliasExtension=.als
\par \pard\plain \s5 \f2\fs20\lang2057 Use this setting to change the file extension used for alias files.  The default is ALS, but you can change it if there is a conflict with other kinds of files.
