\cell \pard\plain \intbl \f3\fs20\lang2057 \row \pard\plain \s5\intbl \f2\fs20\lang2057 Top\cell integer\cell Reserved for future use.\cell \pard\plain \intbl \f3\fs20\lang2057 \row \pard\plain \s5\intbl \f2\fs20\lang2057 Kind\cell integer\cell 
0=Drive, 1=Folder, 2=File, 3=Internet\cell \pard\plain \intbl \f3\fs20\lang2057 \row \pard\plain \s5\intbl \f2\fs20\lang2057 Target\cell string\cell Contains a full pathname or URL\cell \pard\plain \intbl \f3\fs20\lang2057 \row \pard\plain \s5\intbl 
