Icon index\cell integer\cell \cell \pard\plain \intbl \f3\fs20\lang2057 \row \pard\plain \s5\intbl \f2\fs20\lang2057 Parameters\cell string\cell \cell \pard\plain \intbl \f3\fs20\lang2057 \row \pard\plain \s5\intbl \f2\fs20\lang2057 Working folder\cell 
