\par 
\par If you have a query, please study the help and readme files carefully -- the main features of Calmira should be fully documented.  If you have Internet access, then visit the home page first.  Before sending bug reports, make sure you have read the {
\uldb Troubleshooting}{\v Trouble}, {\uldb Known Issues}{\v KnownIssues} and {\uldb Questions & Answers}{\v QandA} sections. 
